WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:55.400


00:01:09.625 --> 00:01:12.745
One more shot please. One, two, three.

00:01:13.465 --> 00:01:15.665
Beautiful. Thank you.

00:01:18.945 --> 00:01:21.905
Marriage means you're no longer alone.

00:01:22.585 --> 00:01:24.145
Whatever you do,

00:01:24.705 --> 00:01:26.905
always think of the other person.

00:01:28.865 --> 00:01:31.145
I wish you both happiness.

00:01:40.545 --> 00:01:42.705
Take good care of Fun for me.

00:01:45.265 --> 00:01:47.825
-Yes.
-If things get tough,

00:01:47.905 --> 00:01:48.945
please forgive each other.

00:01:49.025 --> 00:01:52.865
Marriage is just the beginning
of a shared life.

00:01:53.465 --> 00:01:54.825
Some days will be happy,

00:01:55.425 --> 00:01:56.425
some will be sad.

00:01:57.425 --> 00:02:00.785
Sometimes, you'll be angry
or upset with each other.

00:02:01.425 --> 00:02:04.505
Just don't let it go too far.

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:08.105
I wish you happiness.

00:02:08.185 --> 00:02:09.665
Thank you.

00:02:14.865 --> 00:02:17.665
A happy marriage

00:02:17.745 --> 00:02:21.065
needs a good standard of life.

00:02:21.145 --> 00:02:23.065
The house must be clean

00:02:23.145 --> 00:02:24.305
and hygienic.

00:02:24.385 --> 00:02:27.985
Food should be proper and of good quality,

00:02:28.065 --> 00:02:29.825
and delicious too.

00:02:29.905 --> 00:02:33.865
Fun, you need to practice.
You need to learn more.

00:02:35.425 --> 00:02:36.425
Yes.

00:02:38.185 --> 00:02:39.425
Mom.

00:02:41.145 --> 00:02:42.025
Oh.

00:02:44.025 --> 00:02:45.065
Well,

00:02:45.145 --> 00:02:48.665
I wish you both happiness then.

00:02:53.305 --> 00:02:54.665
-And--
-Me too.

00:02:54.745 --> 00:02:57.865
I also wish you both lots of happiness.

00:02:59.385 --> 00:03:02.145
Alright, that's everyone.
The ceremony is complete.

00:03:02.825 --> 00:03:05.905
Let's leave the two of them be.

00:03:06.705 --> 00:03:08.065
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

00:03:08.145 --> 00:03:09.105
Of course.

00:03:09.625 --> 00:03:10.865
-Thank you.
-Thank you.

00:03:10.945 --> 00:03:11.905
Return the wai.

00:03:28.505 --> 00:03:30.985
Your blessing was very impressive.

00:03:31.065 --> 00:03:34.945
You spoke just like
a truly kind and virtuous elder.

00:03:41.225 --> 00:03:42.305
I'll take my leave now.

00:03:47.145 --> 00:03:47.985
Calm down.

00:03:48.065 --> 00:03:49.225
Priaw.

00:03:50.625 --> 00:03:52.825
You heard that, right? She insulted me.

00:03:52.905 --> 00:03:55.545
Come on, go easy, Auntie.

00:03:55.625 --> 00:03:57.385
I am.

00:03:57.465 --> 00:03:58.705
Well.

00:03:58.785 --> 00:04:01.545
It's not like I'm pleased about it.

00:04:01.625 --> 00:04:04.385
But I don't want any problems with Oon.

00:04:06.545 --> 00:04:08.265
Your daughter loves her.

00:04:09.585 --> 00:04:12.505
The car's waiting downstairs. Let's go.
I'll lock up the house for Oon.

00:04:13.305 --> 00:04:14.425
Fine. Let's go.

00:04:14.505 --> 00:04:16.624
Calm down.

00:04:19.105 --> 00:04:21.225
Don't go down too fast, Priaw.

00:04:21.305 --> 00:04:22.505
Yeah, I know.

00:04:22.585 --> 00:04:24.425
-I don't want to run into them.
-Yeah, let's go.

00:04:33.065 --> 00:04:35.345
-Are you tired?
-Not at all.

00:04:35.425 --> 00:04:37.185
I'm very, very happy.

00:04:39.585 --> 00:04:41.825
Let's take some selfies,
to have them as memories.

00:05:14.745 --> 00:05:15.705
Come here.

00:05:26.065 --> 00:05:27.105
Thank you.

00:05:27.185 --> 00:05:28.345
Here, let me help you.

00:05:30.345 --> 00:05:31.665
Done.

00:05:31.745 --> 00:05:32.825
Thank you.

00:05:38.545 --> 00:05:41.105
I'll help you take off your dress.

00:06:22.745 --> 00:06:25.425
Oon, no, the dress will tear.

00:06:28.465 --> 00:06:29.865
It won't.

00:07:08.625 --> 00:07:10.305
Let's shower first.

00:07:11.025 --> 00:07:12.625
We can shower later.

00:07:12.705 --> 00:07:16.265
No, take a shower first.
It's been since this morning.

00:07:20.585 --> 00:07:21.465
The bathroom…

00:07:22.945 --> 00:07:24.465
Alright, let's shower first.

00:08:02.345 --> 00:08:04.625
It's hard to believe
we made it to this day.

00:08:06.945 --> 00:08:09.465
Do you remember the first day we met?

00:08:11.225 --> 00:08:14.385
Of course. I remember everything.

00:08:25.305 --> 00:08:26.345
Thank you

00:08:26.425 --> 00:08:29.585
for making me
the happiest person in the world.

00:08:34.144 --> 00:08:35.024
No.

00:08:35.664 --> 00:08:38.705
I'm the lucky one.

00:08:42.745 --> 00:08:43.904
I love you.

00:08:45.825 --> 00:08:46.945
I love you too.

00:11:19.025 --> 00:11:20.345
Morning.

00:11:27.665 --> 00:11:28.785
Morning.

00:12:29.505 --> 00:12:31.425
No.

00:12:35.745 --> 00:12:39.305
We have to get up now.
We have a mission today.

00:12:39.385 --> 00:12:40.705
A mission?

00:12:42.025 --> 00:12:43.105
What mission?

00:12:43.185 --> 00:12:46.065
The wedding's already over.

00:12:46.585 --> 00:12:48.785
I even took the day off.

00:12:49.585 --> 00:12:50.945
What are we doing?

00:12:52.465 --> 00:12:55.705
Our mission is to open the presents.

00:12:58.905 --> 00:13:01.345
The great mission.

00:13:02.705 --> 00:13:03.865
Of course.

00:13:16.145 --> 00:13:18.105
But before any mission,

00:13:18.185 --> 00:13:19.825
we need to refuel first.

00:13:26.465 --> 00:13:27.345
Here.

00:13:27.945 --> 00:13:28.865
Thank you.

00:13:39.545 --> 00:13:40.945
Go ahead, eat.

00:14:26.705 --> 00:14:28.865
You can start opening them first.

00:14:28.945 --> 00:14:31.665
I'll take care of the dishes.

00:14:31.745 --> 00:14:32.985
Do you want to do it together?

00:14:33.065 --> 00:14:34.665
There are gifts from your friends too.

00:14:34.745 --> 00:14:35.705
I can wait.

00:14:37.265 --> 00:14:41.065
They're our gifts.
What's mine is yours too.

00:14:41.865 --> 00:14:45.145
Go ahead. I'll enjoy watching from here.

00:14:45.985 --> 00:14:47.385
Thank you.

00:15:06.785 --> 00:15:08.105
A vase?

00:15:11.265 --> 00:15:12.665
Wow.

00:15:13.905 --> 00:15:16.865
A tea set. It's so pretty.

00:15:43.505 --> 00:15:44.905
Did you just move in?

00:15:44.985 --> 00:15:46.465
Uh, yes.

00:15:46.545 --> 00:15:49.705
I'm Aunt Chawee.
You can just call me Aunt Wi.

00:15:49.785 --> 00:15:54.425
Alright, Aunt Wi.
My name is Aioon. Nice to meet you.

00:15:54.505 --> 00:15:55.665
What was your name again?

00:15:55.745 --> 00:15:56.705
Aioon.

00:15:56.785 --> 00:15:57.745
Aioon?

00:15:59.945 --> 00:16:00.785
Hey,

00:16:00.865 --> 00:16:05.545
if you ever need anything
or have any problems, let me know.

00:16:05.625 --> 00:16:08.105
We're neighbors, after all, okay?

00:16:08.185 --> 00:16:09.825
Shall we exchange contact numbers?

00:16:09.905 --> 00:16:12.105
I didn't bring my phone.

00:16:12.905 --> 00:16:15.225
Just tell me your ID.
I'll type it in. I'm very fast.

00:16:15.305 --> 00:16:17.065
I'd better type it for you. It's long.

00:16:17.145 --> 00:16:19.745
I'm good at typing. Just tell me.

00:16:19.825 --> 00:16:21.865
Gxcvbnm79.

00:16:22.705 --> 00:16:23.985
You type it, dear.

00:16:24.065 --> 00:16:24.905
Sure.

00:16:25.745 --> 00:16:27.145
I'll type it for you.

00:16:29.865 --> 00:16:31.785
-There, done.
-Alright, I'll add you.

00:16:31.865 --> 00:16:35.265
I'll head back inside now.
I still have things to unpack.

00:16:36.185 --> 00:16:37.705
Oh, okay. Don't forget.

00:16:37.785 --> 00:16:40.505
You can message me anytime, 24/7.
I'm always happy to help.

00:16:43.545 --> 00:16:44.465
Goodbye.

00:16:54.225 --> 00:16:56.465
Pa, come here.

00:16:56.545 --> 00:16:57.465
-Hurry.
-What?

00:16:57.545 --> 00:16:58.705
I've got something to update you on.

00:16:58.785 --> 00:17:00.545
Guess what it is.

00:17:00.625 --> 00:17:01.585
What's on your face?

00:17:01.665 --> 00:17:02.505
Hey!

00:17:03.225 --> 00:17:05.545
Don't touch my lucky beauty mark.

00:17:06.545 --> 00:17:10.025
You just stuck something on your face.
I thought it was tapioca from bubble tea.

00:17:10.665 --> 00:17:12.265
You're underestimating it.

00:17:12.345 --> 00:17:14.944
This is the highest level
of fashion in this neighborhood.

00:17:15.025 --> 00:17:16.545
So what's the update?

00:17:16.625 --> 00:17:17.665
Yeah.

00:17:17.745 --> 00:17:20.464
I met our new neighbor.

00:17:20.545 --> 00:17:23.424
Her name is Aioon.
But I didn't see her husband.

00:17:23.505 --> 00:17:26.825
Auntie, if you want to be nosy,
keep your voice down.

00:17:26.905 --> 00:17:27.944
-Was I loud?
-Yes.

00:17:28.025 --> 00:17:29.585
Sorry.

00:17:30.105 --> 00:17:32.825
And how do you know
she even has a husband?

00:17:32.905 --> 00:17:35.585
Well, I heard it from a high-level source.

00:17:35.665 --> 00:17:39.025
The workers who built the house
said it's a bridal home.

00:17:39.625 --> 00:17:41.825
But I think they're a female couple.

00:17:43.025 --> 00:17:44.225
Last night,

00:17:44.305 --> 00:17:46.745
I saw two brides getting out of the car.

00:17:46.825 --> 00:17:50.145
What? You had that kind of info
and didn't tell me?

00:18:10.705 --> 00:18:12.585
Why did you take so long?

00:18:12.665 --> 00:18:16.505
A neighbor came over to say hello,
so I stopped to chat.

00:18:16.585 --> 00:18:19.305
-A neighbor?
-Mm, yes.

00:18:19.385 --> 00:18:22.705
An auntie who lives next door.

00:18:22.785 --> 00:18:23.945
Oh, I see.

00:18:25.305 --> 00:18:27.825
Hey, Oon-oon, you got a message.

00:18:36.265 --> 00:18:38.945
Fun, what day is it today?

00:18:41.385 --> 00:18:43.865
Tuesday.

00:18:44.665 --> 00:18:48.745
You know, I've already gotten

00:18:48.825 --> 00:18:50.545
two "Happy Tuesday" messages today.

00:18:50.625 --> 00:18:51.465
HAPPY TUESDAY

00:18:54.985 --> 00:18:55.905
That's lovely.

00:18:58.385 --> 00:19:01.585
Are you going to reply?

00:19:01.665 --> 00:19:02.865
Good question.

00:19:03.505 --> 00:19:06.985
I'll find one of those messages
my mom used to send and reply with that.

00:20:01.385 --> 00:20:03.985
Can you give me a minute?
I need to finish some work

00:20:04.065 --> 00:20:05.745
before I send it to--

00:20:21.025 --> 00:20:22.105
Where?

00:20:23.745 --> 00:20:24.625
Here?

00:20:33.345 --> 00:20:34.545
Here?

00:20:37.105 --> 00:20:38.625
Or…

00:20:41.705 --> 00:20:42.665
here?

00:20:57.905 --> 00:21:00.985
Anywhere, just not here.

00:21:01.585 --> 00:21:03.465
Okay. Not here.

00:21:04.345 --> 00:21:08.305
Hey, Aioon. No, stop playing.

00:21:08.385 --> 00:21:11.345
-I'm not playing. I'm serious.
-Stop.

00:21:12.625 --> 00:21:13.945
Fun.

00:21:15.585 --> 00:21:17.305
Still not ready yet?

00:21:53.505 --> 00:21:54.465
You look beautiful.

00:22:05.385 --> 00:22:07.305
I have nothing to wear.

00:22:07.385 --> 00:22:08.585
Huh?

00:22:09.785 --> 00:22:12.025
Nothing to wear?

00:22:12.625 --> 00:22:13.465
Yes.

00:22:13.545 --> 00:22:15.785
Then what are all these?

00:22:15.865 --> 00:22:17.465
And these?

00:22:17.545 --> 00:22:19.105
These aren't clothes?

00:22:20.985 --> 00:22:22.905
Well, I've gained weight.

00:22:22.985 --> 00:22:24.745
Some are too big,

00:22:24.825 --> 00:22:26.505
some are too small,

00:22:27.065 --> 00:22:29.705
and some I've worn too often.

00:22:29.785 --> 00:22:31.145
Like…

00:22:32.225 --> 00:22:33.145
this one.

00:22:35.265 --> 00:22:36.665
And some

00:22:37.905 --> 00:22:39.825
that you haven't even worn yet.

00:22:43.545 --> 00:22:44.505
Did I buy those?

00:22:44.585 --> 00:22:47.345
Yes, you did. Two bags.

00:22:47.425 --> 00:22:49.305
Oon-oon, did you hide my clothes?

00:22:49.385 --> 00:22:51.105
Me? Hide them?

00:22:51.185 --> 00:22:53.265
They've been
in your closet this whole time.

00:22:57.745 --> 00:22:58.665
What?

00:23:00.745 --> 00:23:02.305
Wait, Fun.

00:23:03.425 --> 00:23:04.305
What are you doing?

00:23:04.385 --> 00:23:05.945
That's my closet.

00:23:06.025 --> 00:23:07.625
Mine is full.

00:23:08.425 --> 00:23:11.825
You have one, two, three, four, five…

00:23:12.465 --> 00:23:15.825
five closets and they're all full?
I only have two.

00:23:15.905 --> 00:23:18.265
And they're not full yet.
There's still space.

00:23:22.505 --> 00:23:24.465
Oon-oon, you decide, what should we eat?

00:23:26.065 --> 00:23:27.105
Me?

00:23:28.745 --> 00:23:31.505
I'm easy. I can eat anything.

00:23:33.065 --> 00:23:34.385
Alright, how about BBQ?

00:23:34.465 --> 00:23:37.025
No, my hair will smell. I just washed it.

00:23:37.105 --> 00:23:38.465
Then shabu?

00:23:38.545 --> 00:23:40.385
No, I don't want anything hot.

00:23:41.065 --> 00:23:42.465
I just saw a doctor.

00:23:42.545 --> 00:23:43.825
Steak, then?

00:23:43.905 --> 00:23:45.705
We just had that yesterday.

00:23:48.425 --> 00:23:51.945
"I'm easy. I can eat anything."

00:23:52.025 --> 00:23:54.105
Yeah, so easy.

00:24:00.585 --> 00:24:03.185
Good afternoon, girls!

00:24:03.265 --> 00:24:07.345
Wait, hold on. Let's chat a bit.

00:24:07.425 --> 00:24:08.465
Alright.

00:24:11.945 --> 00:24:14.265
-Hello.
-Hello, Aunt Wi.

00:24:14.345 --> 00:24:16.705
Thank you
for watering the plants yesterday.

00:24:16.785 --> 00:24:18.585
Oh, never mind.

00:24:18.665 --> 00:24:22.785
Your house is like mine, and mine
is like yours. No need to be shy.

00:24:22.865 --> 00:24:24.745
So where are you going on your day off?

00:24:24.825 --> 00:24:27.945
We're going out to eat.
Do you want anything?

00:24:28.025 --> 00:24:29.865
Oh, no, I don't need anything.

00:24:29.945 --> 00:24:32.705
At first, I thought you weren't home.
I didn't see your car.

00:24:32.785 --> 00:24:33.785
Oh,

00:24:33.865 --> 00:24:36.425
I sent it to get repainted.
It should be back in a couple of days.

00:24:36.505 --> 00:24:39.865
Alright then, go ahead.
Go to the restaurant, enjoy yourselves.

00:24:39.945 --> 00:24:41.545
I'll watch the house for you.

00:24:41.625 --> 00:24:44.025
-Okay.
-Alright.

00:24:50.625 --> 00:24:52.345
You're looking at my beauty mark, right?

00:24:53.025 --> 00:24:54.825
Yes, it's mine.

00:24:54.905 --> 00:24:56.585
It's a lucky one.

00:24:56.665 --> 00:24:59.505
This one helps
with intelligence and awareness.

00:24:59.585 --> 00:25:02.105
There are so many call center scams,
so I have to wear it.

00:25:02.185 --> 00:25:03.585
Oh.

00:25:03.665 --> 00:25:05.265
You can go now.

00:25:08.465 --> 00:25:09.505
Alright.

00:25:09.585 --> 00:25:10.545
Go, go.

00:25:18.545 --> 00:25:20.745
Papaya salad with fermented fish, please.

00:25:21.545 --> 00:25:23.105
Corn salad.

00:25:23.185 --> 00:25:25.865
Fried chicken wings. Grilled pork neck.

00:25:25.945 --> 00:25:28.545
And spicy pork rib soup.

00:25:29.705 --> 00:25:30.865
Do you want anything else?

00:25:31.465 --> 00:25:33.545
Nope.

00:25:38.105 --> 00:25:38.945
That's all.

00:25:43.985 --> 00:25:45.305
Hey, Oon-oon.

00:25:45.385 --> 00:25:46.785
After we eat,

00:25:46.865 --> 00:25:50.105
can I go check out
the shoe shop on the corner?

00:25:50.865 --> 00:25:55.105
I've wanted a pair from there for so long,
and I saw there's a 30% sale.

00:25:56.345 --> 00:25:57.305
Of course.

00:25:59.505 --> 00:26:03.585
Actually, you don't even have to wait
for a sale. You can just buy them.

00:26:04.185 --> 00:26:06.265
No, I have to ask you first.

00:26:09.065 --> 00:26:12.025
Fun, I already told you.

00:26:12.105 --> 00:26:15.625
You're in charge of all the finances.

00:26:17.585 --> 00:26:21.825
If you want to buy something,
you can decide. You don't have to ask me.

00:26:24.985 --> 00:26:26.905
What if…

00:26:27.665 --> 00:26:30.105
I spend it all? What will you do then?

00:26:33.305 --> 00:26:35.905
I believe I know you well enough.

00:26:43.385 --> 00:26:44.545
Thank you.

00:27:00.905 --> 00:27:02.065
Oon-oon.

00:27:02.665 --> 00:27:03.665
Yes?

00:27:03.745 --> 00:27:07.065
I told you to not forget to wipe your feet
before stepping into the dry area.

00:27:07.145 --> 00:27:08.865
It's slippery.

00:27:08.945 --> 00:27:09.945
Oh.

00:27:11.465 --> 00:27:12.825
I'll clean it.

00:27:13.425 --> 00:27:14.585
No need.

00:27:22.065 --> 00:27:23.265
And this.

00:27:24.865 --> 00:27:29.025
I don't understand.
Why is the sleeve sticking out?

00:27:29.105 --> 00:27:31.105
Just open the lid and put it inside.

00:27:31.185 --> 00:27:33.705
That's it. What's so hard?

00:27:35.865 --> 00:27:37.425
It's not hard.

00:27:46.505 --> 00:27:47.545
The toothpaste?

00:27:49.665 --> 00:27:52.625
How many times do I have to tell you
to close the cap, or it'll dry out?

00:28:22.945 --> 00:28:24.185
You're putting it there?

00:28:28.025 --> 00:28:30.905
I'm putting… putting…

00:28:30.985 --> 00:28:32.465
putting…

00:28:34.585 --> 00:28:35.865
Here.

00:28:38.665 --> 00:28:40.345
I'll put toothpaste on your brush.

00:29:01.425 --> 00:29:04.305
Can I take this?

00:29:06.265 --> 00:29:07.425
Go ahead.

00:29:32.625 --> 00:29:33.905
Fun.

00:29:34.705 --> 00:29:36.585
Can you leave the curtains open a little?

00:29:36.665 --> 00:29:39.865
I like when the morning light comes in.
It feels refreshing.

00:29:47.145 --> 00:29:49.185
A little more.

00:29:53.745 --> 00:29:54.945
Is this enough?

00:29:58.025 --> 00:30:00.785
That's perfect.

00:30:07.265 --> 00:30:08.225
Thank you.

00:30:09.265 --> 00:30:10.425
Sure.

00:30:15.945 --> 00:30:18.385
Oon-oon,
what temperature is the AC? It's cold.

00:30:27.465 --> 00:30:29.145
Twenty-three.

00:30:29.225 --> 00:30:32.225
That's too cold. Twenty-five is enough.

00:30:32.745 --> 00:30:35.425
Come on, Fun.

00:30:36.545 --> 00:30:38.345
That's too warm.

00:30:38.425 --> 00:30:42.385
Oon, I gave in about the curtains.

00:30:43.905 --> 00:30:46.825
Let's meet in the middle, 24.

00:30:48.705 --> 00:30:50.705
-Twenty-five.
-Alright, twenty-four.

00:30:59.905 --> 00:31:01.345
I'll turn off the lights now.

00:31:02.145 --> 00:31:02.985
Okay.

00:31:15.825 --> 00:31:16.985
Did you forget something?

00:31:17.665 --> 00:31:19.945
Forget what?

00:31:20.025 --> 00:31:23.105
Lights off, water off, plugs unplugged.

00:31:24.185 --> 00:31:25.265
Nothing.

00:31:32.225 --> 00:31:34.225
I know what I forgot.

00:31:37.865 --> 00:31:39.225
Good night.

00:31:39.825 --> 00:31:42.145
My dreams are already good.

00:31:43.065 --> 00:31:46.585
I'm cute, I'm always right.

00:31:49.425 --> 00:31:50.545
Good night.

00:32:04.305 --> 00:32:05.305
Good night.

00:32:06.425 --> 00:32:07.625
Good night.

00:32:34.985 --> 00:32:35.945
Sorry.

00:32:40.305 --> 00:32:42.385
Fun, do you smell something sour?

00:32:47.225 --> 00:32:48.585
Oh.

00:32:49.425 --> 00:32:52.025
Found it. It's mine.

00:32:54.225 --> 00:32:56.225
-Pafun.
-Stop.

00:32:56.905 --> 00:32:59.385
It's okay. I'll throw it away.

00:33:11.385 --> 00:33:14.625
Do you know that the smell of spoiled
things can stay in the car for hours?

00:33:14.705 --> 00:33:17.305
-And if we don't--
-I know, I know.

00:33:17.385 --> 00:33:18.625
It's my fault.

00:33:18.705 --> 00:33:21.185
From now on,
if I bring anything to eat in the car,

00:33:21.265 --> 00:33:23.385
I won't forget to throw it away again.

00:33:24.665 --> 00:33:28.305
-I said--
-Can you not rub it in? I was wrong.

00:33:29.225 --> 00:33:32.625
It's a workday morning.
We should stay cheerful.

00:33:32.705 --> 00:33:34.825
Do you want me to feel down?

00:33:34.905 --> 00:33:36.585
What if I can't work properly

00:33:36.665 --> 00:33:40.025
and get fired? Is that what you want?

00:33:41.425 --> 00:33:42.985
Huh?

00:33:44.705 --> 00:33:49.065
I… don't think it's that serious.

00:33:56.465 --> 00:33:58.625
Let's go to work, alright?

00:33:58.705 --> 00:33:59.585
Come here.

00:34:10.385 --> 00:34:13.465
Stay cheerful.

00:34:47.905 --> 00:34:50.425
Hey, Pafun, Opal.

00:34:52.905 --> 00:34:55.705
Why does it feel like
we never see each other anymore?

00:34:56.344 --> 00:35:00.025
Well, we've been working from home lately,
and I've been on-site a lot.

00:35:00.905 --> 00:35:04.145
Hey, did you hear?
There's a new wall design.

00:35:04.865 --> 00:35:07.225
New wall? Hold on.

00:35:07.745 --> 00:35:10.745
Pause the work for now. Let me talk
about something more important.

00:35:10.825 --> 00:35:12.465
The new clothing collection is out.

00:35:12.545 --> 00:35:14.185
-Let me see. The colors are nice.
-Look.

00:35:14.265 --> 00:35:16.225
Very Pantone-perfect. Here.

00:35:17.785 --> 00:35:19.785
-That's stunning.
-Very lovely.

00:35:19.865 --> 00:35:21.985
-Very trendy.
-Or should we just get the real thing?

00:35:22.065 --> 00:35:24.425
Have you submitted your reports?

00:35:28.545 --> 00:35:29.465
Peter.

00:35:29.545 --> 00:35:31.265
All done, Peter.

00:35:31.345 --> 00:35:33.985
Yes, just uploading now, Peter.

00:35:35.345 --> 00:35:39.145
And yours, Pafun?
Mr. Sansuk's house project, is it done?

00:35:39.745 --> 00:35:40.785
Almost finished.

00:35:40.865 --> 00:35:43.945
Just a few final details,
then the client can inspect it.

00:35:44.665 --> 00:35:48.425
Also, I'm bidding on the housing project,
just like in the report I submitted.

00:35:49.785 --> 00:35:51.465
Peter, look.

00:35:51.545 --> 00:35:53.305
This collection even has baby items.

00:35:53.385 --> 00:35:56.705
The colors are so cute.

00:35:56.785 --> 00:35:58.745
Every color looks great, Peter.

00:35:58.825 --> 00:36:01.825
-You should just buy the whole collection.
-Seriously.

00:36:02.865 --> 00:36:03.705
Is it expensive?

00:36:03.785 --> 00:36:05.025
Not at all.

00:36:05.105 --> 00:36:07.745
-Just get the whole set.
-Yes, just get everything.

00:36:07.825 --> 00:36:10.425
Look, so adorable. And look at this part.

00:36:10.505 --> 00:36:11.665
It's nice.

00:36:11.745 --> 00:36:12.905
Here.

00:36:12.985 --> 00:36:14.585
This color looks nice.

00:36:14.665 --> 00:36:16.745
Such a cheerful morning.

00:36:21.065 --> 00:36:23.505
That's all for today's details.

00:36:23.585 --> 00:36:26.545
As for the remaining points and revisions,

00:36:26.625 --> 00:36:28.305
we'll schedule another meeting.

00:36:29.905 --> 00:36:33.585
Ms. Nan, please coordinate
the details with Nu.

00:36:34.185 --> 00:36:35.225
Sure.

00:36:35.305 --> 00:36:36.265
Thank you.

00:36:42.545 --> 00:36:44.065
-Oon.
-Hmm?

00:36:44.145 --> 00:36:48.345
I heard something, but it hasn't been
confirmed yet. There's a foreign investor

00:36:48.425 --> 00:36:51.265
planning to build a condo
in the city center.

00:36:52.505 --> 00:36:53.745
Is it our company's project?

00:36:53.825 --> 00:36:54.705
Yeah.

00:36:55.825 --> 00:36:58.345
The current workload
is already overwhelming.

00:36:58.425 --> 00:37:00.465
I just finished the dimension summary.

00:37:00.985 --> 00:37:03.905
Just hearing that gave me a headache.
Same here.

00:37:03.985 --> 00:37:07.425
My design still hasn't been finalized
with the owner. It keeps getting revised.

00:37:07.505 --> 00:37:11.265
Then let's leave it to the future.

00:37:11.865 --> 00:37:14.065
Let's focus on finishing
our current projects first.

00:37:14.145 --> 00:37:15.145
Yeah.

00:37:16.665 --> 00:37:20.425
Any plans after work?
Are you going anywhere?

00:37:21.785 --> 00:37:23.825
Not really, but I need to pick up Fun.

00:37:24.585 --> 00:37:26.745
Her car's in the paint shop.

00:37:27.705 --> 00:37:30.145
Alright. Don't say I didn't invite you.

00:37:30.225 --> 00:37:31.425
I'm going now.

00:37:32.345 --> 00:37:33.265
See you.

00:37:46.985 --> 00:37:49.665
Fun, you can go shower first.

00:37:49.745 --> 00:37:51.665
I just need to finish a little more work.

00:37:53.225 --> 00:37:54.625
Want me to warm up the pad thai?

00:37:56.345 --> 00:37:57.665
Maybe not yet.

00:38:02.065 --> 00:38:06.105
I don't have to go to the office tomorrow.
No need to leave extra time for me.

00:38:06.185 --> 00:38:07.465
Okay.

00:39:03.505 --> 00:39:04.945
You still haven't eaten the pad thai?

00:39:05.945 --> 00:39:07.265
Not yet.

00:39:07.345 --> 00:39:09.625
Let me finish a little more work first.

00:39:25.665 --> 00:39:27.265
Why don't you go sleep upstairs?

00:39:55.265 --> 00:39:56.385
Oon.

00:39:58.825 --> 00:40:01.625
Oon, it's morning.

00:40:03.025 --> 00:40:05.625
Wake up. Oon.

00:40:08.465 --> 00:40:09.385
It's morning already.

00:40:20.705 --> 00:40:23.705
-Have you been that busy lately?
-Yes.

00:40:24.305 --> 00:40:27.425
I have to finalize the structural
standards and send them to the owner.

00:40:29.545 --> 00:40:31.865
Oh, let me hurry and take a shower first.

00:40:32.785 --> 00:40:36.065
-Then I'll prepare breakfast for you.
-It's okay.

00:40:36.665 --> 00:40:39.545
I probably won't have time to eat.
Thank you, though.

00:40:55.185 --> 00:40:59.665
RECIPE

00:41:02.185 --> 00:41:04.185
INGREDIENTS

00:41:04.265 --> 00:41:06.945
OLIVE OIL, OREGANO

00:41:07.025 --> 00:41:08.705
SALT, BLACK PEPPER

00:41:58.585 --> 00:41:59.625
Yes, Fun?

00:41:59.705 --> 00:42:01.465
How's work today?

00:42:02.265 --> 00:42:05.505
It's fine. I submitted it already.
It's not too hectic anymore.

00:42:08.025 --> 00:42:12.985
Aioon, after work today,
come straight home. We need to talk.

00:42:15.945 --> 00:42:17.625
About what?

00:42:18.585 --> 00:42:21.305
Let's talk when you get home. That's all.

00:42:22.585 --> 00:42:23.625
Huh?

00:42:28.625 --> 00:42:29.665
What did I do wrong?

00:42:31.145 --> 00:42:32.145
Breakfast?

00:42:33.265 --> 00:42:35.265
Or did I forget
to close the toothpaste again?

00:42:36.625 --> 00:42:37.865
Probably not.

00:42:52.065 --> 00:42:53.665
INCOMING CALL - MOM

00:42:57.345 --> 00:42:58.545
Yes, Mom?

00:42:58.625 --> 00:43:00.105
Oon, where are you?

00:43:01.505 --> 00:43:03.705
On the road. I'm heading home.

00:43:03.785 --> 00:43:08.145
I'm in Bangkok for Aunt Kaew's funeral.

00:43:08.225 --> 00:43:11.945
I want you to come pick me up
around 7:00 at Wat Dokmai.

00:43:12.025 --> 00:43:14.785
And tonight,
I'm going to stay at your house.

00:43:14.865 --> 00:43:16.185
Huh?

00:43:16.265 --> 00:43:17.585
Huh what?

00:43:17.665 --> 00:43:19.305
Why? Can't I stay at your house?

00:43:19.945 --> 00:43:22.625
No, you can. Of course you can.

00:43:22.705 --> 00:43:24.665
Then hurry up and come get me.

00:43:24.745 --> 00:43:25.585
Okay.

00:43:30.025 --> 00:43:30.865
MOM

00:43:33.585 --> 00:43:34.665
PAFUN

00:43:34.745 --> 00:43:35.945
NU (BOSS)

00:43:38.905 --> 00:43:39.985
Yes, Nu?

00:44:10.945 --> 00:44:14.185
OON-OON

00:44:31.825 --> 00:44:32.745
Mom.

00:44:34.545 --> 00:44:38.385
Why are you carrying that yourself?
Why didn't you wait for me?

00:44:38.465 --> 00:44:40.385
Because you were taking forever.

00:44:40.905 --> 00:44:43.505
You know your back hurts,
and you're still being stubborn.

00:44:43.585 --> 00:44:46.185
Tomorrow, let's go to the hospital.
I'll take you myself.

00:44:47.345 --> 00:44:49.265
Don't make such a big deal out of it.

00:44:49.345 --> 00:44:52.105
If I really can't manage,
I'll go by myself.

00:46:57.025 --> 00:46:58.545
Hello.

00:47:00.305 --> 00:47:01.865
I've been thinking about this for a while.

00:47:01.945 --> 00:47:04.945
I want you to move into a retirement home.

00:47:05.745 --> 00:47:07.625
Fun, no!

00:47:07.705 --> 00:47:08.625
‎Mom!

00:47:08.705 --> 00:47:11.825
Fun, why weren't you more careful?
You know Mom's back hurts.

00:47:11.905 --> 00:47:12.905
I'm coming with you, Oon.

00:47:12.985 --> 00:47:13.985
No need.

00:47:14.065 --> 00:47:16.385
Maybe we're really going to break up.

00:47:16.465 --> 00:47:18.465
Oon has never raised her voice at me.

00:47:18.545 --> 00:47:20.625
You should value yourself

00:47:20.705 --> 00:47:23.825
and walk away from that person's life.

00:47:54.425 --> 00:47:56.625
Subtitle translation by: Panuwat Baikeawon